417] [17592186483280 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483002 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483280 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483222 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483280 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483280 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483280 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186482905 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483280 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "6d527e9c-2e5b-5948-a599-77a3b28decc4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483378 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186483242 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483378 #edb/ref 1069 "q-132281" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483378 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483378 #edb/ref 1071 "${\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\text{ }x(y-1)\\,dy\\,dx=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483378 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "790fc9b6-72db-52a7-bf88-41ac2c2d70f6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483378 #edb/ref 1074 "The integral is defined over a type I region.\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\text{ }x(y-1)\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x[{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\text{ }(y-1)\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x{[\\frac{1}{2}{y}^{2}-y]}_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x(\\frac{1}{2}(1-{x}^{2})-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{2}(1-{x}^{2})-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}})dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x(-2\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}})dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}-2x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}-2x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}\\,dx & ={[\\frac{2(1-{x}^{2})^{3/2}}{3}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =0-\\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483386 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186483278 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483386 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81344" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483386 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483386 #edb/ref 1071 "If $D$ is the finite region enclosed by the curves $y=1-{x}^{2}$ and $y=x-1,$ then ${∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483386 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "888487e0-300d-510a-97fe-31196306b818" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483386 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's make a sketch of our region.\n\n![](images/24/24683f81da1c7e90ccbd51748f5f46407137be4a40ef5f0678292b70f0781eff.png)\n\nNow, let's represent $D$ as a type I region. \n\n- To determine the $x$-limits, we need to find the $x$-coordinates of the points at which the curves intersect. So, we set the following equation and solve it for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-{x}^{2} & =x-1 \\\\ {x}^{2}+x-2 & =0 \\\\ (x+2)(x-1) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $x$-limits are \n$-2\\le x\\le 1.$\n\n- To determine the lower and upper functions, we draw a vertical arrow through the region.\n\n![](images/e9/e955ad94bca70a8e6f996d81814ffa8fcc7a322d5979db7b0726d39558b6aa86.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le 1,\\,x-1\\le y\\le 1-{x}^{2}\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={\\int }_{-2}^{1}{\\int }_{x-1}^{1-{x}^{2}}f(x,y)\\text{ }dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{1}[{\\int }_{x-1}^{1-{x}^{2}}f(x,y)\\text{ }dy]dx\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483407 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186483280 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483407 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81369" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483407 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483407 #edb/ref 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}8x{y}^{3}\\,dA,\\,$\nwhere $D$ is the finite region enclosed by the circle ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=1$ and below the $x$-axis." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483407 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c45bffe5-25bf-5869-8e87-fa24cb3ec218" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483407 #edb/ref 1074 "Since $y\\le 0,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=1\\,⟹\\,y=-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nLet's make a sketch of our region.\n\n![](images/9c/9c6b1dd7d81d124888ddd588027eed908a0eaecb2c42ebc79f3253c4123dbe86.png)\n\nNotice that $D$ is a type I region.\n\n- We already know the intersection of the circle with the line $y=0.$\nSo, the $x$-limits are \n$-1\\le x\\le 1.$\n\n- To determine the lower and upper functions, we draw a vertical arrow through the region.\n\n![](images/bd/bd584d7481549b792e786a7186ba7ee87cd536258c5a0135f36ee17d96c4880d.png)\n\nAs a result, the integral is defined over the following type I region: \n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-1\\le x\\le 1,\\,-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}\\le y\\le 0\\}\n$$\n\nSo, we can express the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}8x{y}^{3}\\,dA={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{0}8x{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx\n$$\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{0}8x{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}2x[{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{0}4{y}^{3}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}2x{[{y}^{4}]}_{-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{0}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}2x(0-{(-\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}})}^{4})\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}(-2x(1-{x}^{2})^{2})\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}(-2x(1-{x}^{2})^{2})\\,dx & ={[\\frac{(1-{x}^{2})^{3}}{3}]}_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{(1-{1}^{2})^{3}}{3}-\\frac{(1-(-1)^{2})^{3}}{3} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483434 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483479 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483434 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0ba397eb-27d1-5f99-9aee-673204cdeaff" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483434 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186483386 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483453 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3af15913-e8bd-5162-bb11-0248e7dc9e39" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483453 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186268855 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483479 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483480 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483479 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8054baf7-76fc-513c-bc8c-95f9b72f74a0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483479 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186351295 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483480 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483501 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483480 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "85ca4b6f-ad35-500c-8f70-cb09fc202e4f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483480 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186483407 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483501 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483453 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483501 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "dc3dd7a9-c45b-51da-a49f-0da3682d6427" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483501 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186483378 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
